    "updated_at": "2025-11-25T21:42:04Z",
    "body": "Agreed, I don't see the issue here. Of course it looks like Chromium's [`FragmentDirective` interface](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/renderer/core/fragment_directive/fragment_directive.idl;l=10-11;drc=047c7dc4ee1ce908d7fea38ca063fa2f80f92c77) is NOT empty, which is confusing to me for the reasons that @annevk brought up. @bokand, and insight into what's happening here?",
