    "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:07:12Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-11-26T16:07:12Z",
    "body": "The additional fields in Chromium are behind a flag and from additions we were considering and prototyping - I think we can remove them to avoid confusion...\n\nThe fragmentDirective interface was primarily intended as a way to feature detect and potential area for future extension but yeah, currently it's just empty.",
