    "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:52:53Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-11-30T20:52:53Z",
    "body": "However, searching for the same text fragment several times would introduce unnecessary work and would cause timing differences. So, from an user agent's point of view, it might make sense to make the list of text directives unique after parsing them from the fragment and before searching the document. I'm not sure this needs to be added to the spec though, or if that's just an implementation detail.",
